      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْتَرُ</span></b>  A man <i>having the affection of the eyelid
described above, voce</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَتِرَ</span>: (S, A, Mgh, Msb:)
or <i>having the eyelid slit:</i> (IAar, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شرم</span>:)
fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَتْرَآءُ</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A man <i>having his lower
lip cracked:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَفَةٌ شَتْرَآءُ</span> <i>a cracked lip.</i> (TA.)

